  "description": "American artist Llynx Rufus brings us a light-hearted tale from the Napoleonic War era in Light Horse and Cannon. When Hungarian Voros Macska (his friends call him Paprika) of the 5th Hussars wanders wounded into the Hess-Darmstadt Artillery camp, German Corporal Hans Mintz is eager to tend to his wounds using an aromatic extract from the family PFEFFERMINTZ industry. Get it? Paprika + Mintz = peppermintz? More than just clever wordplay is at stake as these two uncommon lovers share a common secret between them and the flaps of their rain-soaked military tent.",
